   "source": [
    "# AI Artifact Removal Pipeline\n",
    "### Production-ready multi-stage cleanup for AI-generated images\n",
    "\n",
    "**Reads from:** `Google Drive / artwork /`  \n",
    "**Writes to:** `Google Drive / artwork_cleaned /`\n",
    "\n",
    "| Stage | Purpose |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| **1 - Detection** | Edge density - FFT - Entropy - Laplacian - Wavelet - Repetition |\n",
    "| **2 - Preservation** | Major contours - Color regions - Gradient structure |\n",
    "| **3 - Suppression** | NLM - Bilateral - Wavelet denoising - Frequency cleanup - Guided filter |\n",
    "| **4 - Restoration** | RealESRGAN (general / anime) or SwinIR (GPU-accelerated) |\n",
    "| **5 - Refinement** | Color consistency - Texture harmonization - Edge stabilization |\n",
    "\n",
    "> **GPU required** for Stage 4. Enable via `Runtime > Change runtime type > T4 GPU`.\n"
   ]
  },
